            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo ndivyo mtakavyojua ya kuwa mimi ndimi BWANA, Mungu wenu, nikaaye Sayuni, mlima wangu mtakatifu; ndipo Yerusalemu utakapokuwa mtakatifu, wala wageni hawatapita tena ndani yake kamwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
